{"reviews":[{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-0","r":5.0,"t":"Like having another pet","x":"Although it's a little larger than a cat size toy, my cats are totally entertained.  The ball runs around the house like another pet.  Works well on both hard floor and carpet.  Would be great for a dog too.  Remember to open the ball (unscrew the halves) and look for the AA battery compartment if you don't get instructions from the seller.","h":26,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-1","r":5.0,"t":"Like having another pet","x":"Although it's a little larger than a cat size toy, my cats are totally entertained.  The ball runs around the house like another pet.  Works well on both hard floor and carpet.  Would be great for a dog too.  Remember to open the ball (unscrew the halves) and look for the AA battery compartment if you don't get instructions from the seller.","h":26,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-2","r":3.0,"t":"There are no directions, but it needs a battery.","x":"You have to unscrew the ball, then get a small screwdriver and unscrew the screw that is not tightened all the way. Slide the cover over and put a AA battery in.  There are no directions. But once you do that, it will work.","h":25,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-3","r":1.0,"t":"More 'Wobble' than 'Roll'","x":"Added the battery and started it up, set on the floor.  The sound of the ball kind of frightened my dog initially.  However, it began to roll, then stopped in place and merely 'wobbled' back and forth until I intervened and nudged it again.  It rolled for about a foot then started the wobble again; my dog completely lost interest.  Seems like the mechanism is 'underpowered' to keep it moving, but I swapped out batteries to confirm it wasn't merely low voltage causing this wobble effect.  Overall","h":24,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great Toy!!","x":"[[VIDEOID:7ac34345a7762dea81476290dfe39fd7]] My dog absolutely loves it. I recently broke my foot so this keeps him busy for hours","h":22,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-5","r":5.0,"t":"love","x":"i laughted so much at my dog .she worn herself out .and rested thank you .","h":18,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-6","r":5.0,"t":"Worked as expected just challenging to find battery location","x":"It was challenging to find where to put battery. But once you find it, it works as described. They can\u2019t help it that my dog doesn\u2019t like it.","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-7","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t waste your money!","x":"Don\u2019t waste your money!  I ordered two.  One doesn\u2019t work and the other one quit working within a week.","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-8","r":1.0,"t":"Can't open","x":"I will be return this product as it does not work and I can not open it to check the batteries.  There are no instructions and no information on who to ask to resolve problems.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-9","r":1.0,"t":"Not worth it at all","x":"Couldn\u2019t even get the toy to work! No instructions were given and couldn\u2019t find where a battery world go.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-10","r":2.0,"t":"Do not buy.","x":"I love that is rolls by itself and had extra covers. That being said two of covers do not fit and third one was torn before I could use it. Leaving only one that is of use and I don't believe it will last very long. Very disappointed in this product. My dog likes it but is of no use without covers.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-11","r":1.0,"t":"THANK YOU TO ALL THE REVIEWS!","x":"Thank you to all of you who took the time to write a review.  I was really considering it as i thought it would be good for my 5 year old Lab. But since Sadie seems to either destroy or bury almost every toy we get her within hours, I think I have reconsidered! Darn - sounded like such a great idea!","h":9,"v":0,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-12","r":5.0,"t":"Roller ball toy","x":"Cute toy but my cats don't really play with it...watch it and follow it.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-13","r":1.0,"t":"Not eligible for return; item was used before","x":"This item was used before; all the screws inside were already worn out... the ball makes a very strange noise, my cat was actually stressed out seeing the ball and hearing that weird noise. AND item is not eligible for return... really... Amazon... this not the way you treat your loyal customer...","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-14","r":1.0,"t":"Would not buy again","x":"Cheaply made product.  There is a zipper on the ball cover that scratches my floor when it rolls around.  The ball really doesn't roll around that much as advertised.  My dog was uninterested and I ended up throwing it away.  Was not even worth passing along to a friends dog.  Very disappointed!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-15","r":4.0,"t":"Fine","x":"My dogs were unimpressed with this.  I thought they would love it.  They enjoyed the covers more than the ball lol.  Item as described","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-16","r":1.0,"t":"Not for a super chewer!","x":"My dog destroyed this in less than 30 minutes!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-17","r":5.0,"t":"Buen producto","x":"Cumple con lo esperado, mi gato esta feliz","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-18","r":1.0,"t":"Pointless","x":"It just keeps going and going. It never stops like it does in the video. So it just gets annoying after a while. You're better off using a regular tennis ball and rolling it your damn self.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-19","r":2.0,"t":"Wonderful playtime toy","x":"My small dog loved it. However, within 18 hours of opening the package, the item stopped working. Very disappointed. Poor pup keeps barking at it to make it work.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-20","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t waste your money","x":"This didn\u2019t work when it finally arrived. The additional furry covers didn\u2019t all fit the size of ball I was sent. Don\u2019t waste your money.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-21","r":1.0,"t":"Not so great","x":"It didn\u2019t roll like the video showed and the zipper hangs out and cut the inside of my dog\u2019s mouth!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-22","r":4.0,"t":"Wiggly rolling ball is entertaining.","x":"The ferrets just LOVE their new ball!  It even came with 3 extra covers, so it can always be clean and safe for them.  Battery installation was easy per the directions.  It seems to wiggle more than roll, but they are having a blast, so it works out.  My large dogs would have this item torn to shreds if they had the opportunity.  If you have small animals, it is a great toy.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-23","r":3.0,"t":"it works well","x":"When my dog bites it, it comes apart.  I put it back together and we play more.  A more structurally strong ball would be better.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07HYWM5M5-24","r":4.0,"t":"Puppy is not impressed, but I like it.","x":"I think this toy is a hoot. Turn it on and it makes its way thru the house on its own. Sometimes it remains in one spot for a bit but for the most part really travels well, working out of corners and tight places, especially good on hard surface floors. Unfortunately our puppy isn\u2019t all that crazy about it. She\u2019ll chase it for a bit but then walks away leaving me to chase it around.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers report the toy entertains their pets, with dogs and cats watching or playing with it.","cites":[1,2,5,6,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers complain there are no instructions and it is difficult to find or access the battery compartment.","cites":[3,7,9,10]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the ball does not roll well, instead wobbling or stopping, contrary to advertising.","cites":[4,15]},{"text":"A number of reviewers report durability or quality problems, including units that stopped working, worn screws, and torn or ill-fitting covers.","cites":[8,11,14,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the noise frightens or stresses their pets.","cites":[4,14]}]},"qa":[]}